:: OC Arthur Richard Hat Quest Buttons 1 [nobr]

/* Intro */
You spot <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> sitting on the swing and wave, running over. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Right on time, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> jumps off the swing, running over and hugging you. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Thanks again for the help! I really appreciate it. I don’t have much time left.”</span> Curious, you ask him how long until the anniversary and he blushes. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well… I mean… technically, it’s today. I’m meeting him in a few hours, actually.”</span> <span style="color:Yellow">Your eyes widen. A few hours!? How does he expect to sew a hat in a few hours!?</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well, it’s MOSTLY done!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> holds his hands up trying to reassure you, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I just need to put the buttons on and the white tuff, which is why I need your help.”</span> He gives you a nervous smile, fully understanding how crazy this is. You sigh, you two better get to work. <br>

