    You both are about to give up and head to the thrift store when a cry of distress hits your ears. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Wo- woah! Okay, guys, hold on a second-!”</span> The voice is familiar to you and you both sprint over towards the tree’d border <span style="color:Yellow">to find three identical little boys surrounding a familiar face stuck upside down in a tire swing! <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’m- I’m getting kind of dizzy. Think you boys could get me out of here?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> is the pleading voice jammed into the tire upside down with his arms stuck, completely helpless.</span> <br>

