    <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“He’s not a mermaid, he’s a god! And that’s what we are! So, stop being such a baby and use your normal name!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Zeus</span>, the red-shirted one, shouts at his brother. Though the final brother lying in the grass comments that their mom calls him <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Zuzu</span>. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Shut up <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Dez</span>!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Zeus</span> grabs <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s shoe and tosses it at his brother’s head. <span style="color:Yellow">This eventually leads to all three boys fighting in a ball on the ground as you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> help <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> out of his tight situation.</span> <br>
