        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“So, you want the buttons from our shirts? So, you can make a hat for your boyfriend?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Sye</span> says, sounding more than a little judgmental. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That’s stupid. Why don’t you just buy a hat? It’ll probably look better!”</span> <br>
