        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I think it’s the thought that counts.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Dez</span> explains, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Like how you made mom that macaroni necklace for Mother’s Day last year.”</span> <br>
