        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I have an idea.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Dez</span> sits up, <span style="color:Yellow">his uninterested expression now a smile that sends a strange shiver down your spine.</span> He walks over to his brothers and whispers something in their ears. <span style="color:Yellow">Like an infection, the devious smile spreads to the two of them as well. You, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span>, and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> all share a worried look as the boys walk up to you together, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Zeus</span> holding his button between his fingers like a prize.</span> <br>
